  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 0.2 bundle: the 绘图模式 agent preset, whose 18 comfyui_* tools drive a local ComfyUI — Anima/Krea2 generation, LoRA search, Danbooru tags, PNG metadata, Ollama vision, 小番茄 de-obfuscation",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
